# Keep the build context to what the Go build actually needs. Without this the
# whole npm workspace (node_modules, four frontend builds) is uploaded to the
# daemon on every build, which dominates the build time.
node_modules
**/node_modules
apps
packages
tools
dist
**/dist
.git
.github
.turbo
*.md
!go.mod
!go.sum
.env
.env.*
test-output.txt
reference
